# ── project ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# data/vectors.json, data/index-meta.json and data/canned.json ARE committed on
# purpose: the vector store is the database (see README, "No vector database").
# These two are throwaway caches that only exist mid-run.
data/.embed-cache.jsonl
evals/.query-cache.json

# The original build brief. Kept locally, not part of the published project.
01-rag-chatbot.md

# Generated by `npm run eval`. Committed, because the published score has to be
